# NOTE: vendor/pkg/ is deliberately NOT ignored — the built WASM bundle is
# vendored on purpose (see vendor/PROVENANCE.md). wasm-pack writes a
# `.gitignore` containing `*` into its own output directory; that file is
# omitted from the vendored copy, which is why this repo can track it at all.
